1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,740
This horror demo is two hundred and sixty-three megabytes,
and the monster in it hunts by sound.

2
00:00:05,990 --> 00:00:08,256
Every noise you make, it hears.

3
00:00:10,506 --> 00:00:17,631
MORROWTAPE. You're under a condemned 1989 telephone archive with a radio,
tuning in calls that shouldn't exist.

4
00:00:17,881 --> 00:00:21,009
Find the frequency,
take the call, and stay quiet.

5
00:00:21,259 --> 00:00:27,130
Every other horror demo I measured this week was bigger.
This one is small, and it's all atmosphere.

6
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:30,743
English only,
and out on Steam now as a free demo.

7
00:00:31,143 --> 00:00:33,540
Worth a dip if you like your horror quiet.

8
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:37,355
That's Demo Dip.
A new Steam demo, every day.
